    <statement><p>Match each of the trigonometric expressions below with the
equivalent non-trigonometric function from the following list.</p>
<tabular valign="middle">
<row>
<cell><ol>
<li>
<m>\cos(\theta)</m>  where <m>x = 6 \tan \theta</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\tan(\theta)</m> where <m>x = 6 \sin \theta</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\sin(\theta)</m>  where <m>x = 6 \tan \theta</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\cos(\theta)</m>  where <m>x = 6 \sin \theta</m>
</li>
</ol></cell>
<cell><ol label="A.">
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{x}{\sqrt{36 - x^2}}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{6}{\sqrt{36 + x^2}}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{x}{\sqrt{36 + x^2}}</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\displaystyle \frac{\sqrt{36 - x^2}}{6}</m>
</li>
<li>
None of the above
</li>
</ol></cell>
</row>
</tabular>
</statement>
